//
// Expected failures of the CHERIoT memory subsystem bench. A run of cms_regress.list marked
// @xfail=<id> must fail exactly as its entry here says; the one place the signatures live
// (hw/ip/cheriot_mem_sys/dv/cms/scripts/cms_results.py grades the kept runs, and cms_xlm_run.sh -x
// calls it for one run).
//
// A run matches only when all of these hold:
//   - its CMS_RESULT line says FAIL, with at least one error;
//   - every CMS_ERROR line matches one of the entry's `errors` patterns (Python regular
//     expressions, searched in the line). A second, different error fails the run;
//   - the test reached its end: no "test timed out" error, and as many CMS_ERROR lines as the
//     CMS_RESULT line counts;
//   - no simulator error and no SVA failure;
//   - the scoreboard checked something (as for a passing run).
//
// kind (one per entry, with a one-line reason above it):
//   self_check  the run is built to fail, to prove a checker works: graded "PASS (must fail)".
//   known_gap   the RTL misses a requirement: graded "FAIL (known gap <id>)". Never a pass, the
//               testpoint stays unmet; the regression does not go red for it. A run that passes
//               grades "FAILED (known gap now passes, remove the declaration)".
// Anything that is not explicitly a self-check is a known gap.
{
  expected_failures: [
    {
      id: TAG_SIDEBAND_NOT_MUBI4
      // known_gap: the RTL's tag sideband is one bit, not MuBi4, so REQ_CMS_01 is not met.
      kind: known_gap
      requirement: REQ_CMS_01
      reason: The core tag sideband is one bit each way, not MuBi4 (upstream TODO(#31066)).
      errors: [
        '''^CMS_ERROR @\d+ \[test\] REQ_CMS_01: the subsystem's core tag sideband is one bit each way \(.*TODO\(#31066\)\), not MuBi4'''
      ]
    }
    {
      id: NO_LOCKSTEP_COPY
      // known_gap: the RTL has one copy of the subsystem, so REQ_CMS_02 is not met.
      kind: known_gap
      requirement: REQ_CMS_02
      reason: The subsystem has no lockstep copy, so an upset is never detected (upstream TODO(#30572)).
      errors: [
        // The bench says why it cannot upset a second copy ...
        '''^CMS_ERROR @\d+ \[test\] REQ_CMS_02: the subsystem has one copy \(cheriot_mem_sys LOGIC\.SHADOW, TODO\(#30572\)\): no second copy to upset and nothing to compare against'''
        // ... and every upset of the one copy goes undetected,
        '''^CMS_ERROR @\d+ \[test\] upset of main copy: \S+ \(\s*(idle|under traffic)\): fatal_fault not raised within 256 cycles, expected\s+raised$'''
        // and lets the faulty copy's meta SRAM writes through.
        '''^CMS_ERROR @\d+ \[test\] upset of main copy: \S+ \(under traffic\): \d+ meta SRAM write\(s\) by the faulty copy completed before fatal_fault$'''
      ]
    }
    {
      id: TRVK_FAULT_UNDETECTED
      // known_gap: nothing checks the TBRE's load filter, so REQ_CMS_02 (and REQ_CIB_03's rule) is not met.
      kind: known_gap
      requirement: REQ_CMS_02
      reason: A fault in the TBRE's load filter is never detected: no second copy, no check of its logic (upstream TODO(#30572)).
      errors: [
        '''^CMS_ERROR @\d+ \[test\] TRVK fault \d+ at Tf\w+ \(\s*main copy: .* forced to .* for one cycle, opportunity \d+\) undetected: a revoked capability reached the engine tagged and fatal_fault stayed low for 256 cycles \(REQ_CMS_02, REQ_CIB_03\)$'''
      ]
    }
    {
      id: REQ_CMS_07
      // known_gap: the RTL adds a cycle REQ_CMS_07 does not allow.
      kind: known_gap
      requirement: REQ_CMS_07
      reason: Word 1 of a capability store adds one cycle in CHERIoT mode even when its tag is unchanged (RFC Table 2, a preliminary measurement, says none).
      errors: [
        // Exactly the known case: a capability write, word 1 (which never changes the tag: word 0
        // already stored it), CHERIoT mode, one cycle. Any other operation, word, mode or cycle
        // count, or a tag-changing word over its bound, is a different failure.
        '''^CMS_ERROR @\d+ \[test\] capability write at 0x[0-9a-f]+, tag [01] before, storing tag [01], cheriot_ena 0x6, word 1\s*: the subsystem added 1 cycle\(s\), REQ_CMS_07 allows 0\.\.0$'''
      ]
    }
  ]
}
